{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120413001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 혹시 트라이브 잭슨이나 상록수 학회의 엘리노어에 대해 들어보셨나요?","source_cn":"你好！请问，你听说过蛮血贾克松，或是冬青学会的埃莉诺吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27E4E2B811B00F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120413002:1":{"text":"혹은 세일린워터 마을에 잭슨의 어머니를 알고 계신가요?","source_cn":"或者，你是否知道贾克松在咸水镇上有一位母亲呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CBFB7CFBE92A0AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120413003:1":{"text":"잭슨이라면 본 적 있어요. 무섭게 생겨서 말을 섞어본 적은 없지만요.","source_cn":"贾克松，我见过他。他面相很凶，我从没和他搭过话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x592C5EBAD9D62369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120413004:1":{"text":"상록수 학회라면… 가끔 마을에 찾아오는데, 항상 당신들처럼 질문이 많죠.","source_cn":"冬青学会倒是偶尔有来镇上的，那些人总是一大堆问题，像你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F509F0C672FE41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120413005:1":{"text":"마을에 오는 사람들은 하나같이 사람이나 보물을 찾거나… 가끔 신에 관한 전설을 찾아오는 사람도 있어서… 누가 누군지는 모르겠네요...","source_cn":"具体谁是谁，我分不清。所有来镇上的人都在互相打听，要么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0B9873DED78D9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120413006:1":{"text":"정말이지, 그만 좀 왔으면 좋겠네요!","source_cn":"拜托，我们还要生活呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E66C2EF8C2EEE9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:咸水镇民卡莉斯塔":{"text":"칼리스타","source":"咸水镇民卡莉斯塔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}